      "summary": "Builds on Jaren 0.217.0, whose database runs an existence test over a hop that pairs an equality with a comparison of two non-null columns as one native statement on SQLite and PostgreSQL. Tangle issues no such query, so no behaviour changes; the pins, the foundation manifest and the integration audit move to the new release.",
